<title>USA: Imperial Credit ups qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>Imperial Credit ups qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA HEIGHTS, Calif 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Credit Mortgage Holdings Inc said its board increased its first quarter dividend by five percent to $0.58 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on April 15, 1997 to stockholders of record on April 1, 1997.</p>
